body:
While at it, I noticed a typo in the message (also below).

"can't changed" -> "can't be changed"

Would need to be fixed for all platforms:
```
$ rg "can't changed"
platform/macos/display_server_macos.mm
2842:                   ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG([wd.window_object isVisible] && (wd.is_popup != p_enabled), "Popup flag can't changed while window is opened.");

platform/linuxbsd/wayland/display_server_wayland.cpp
1241:                   ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG(wd.visible, "Popup flag can't changed while window is opened.");
1246:                   ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG(wd.visible, "Popup hint can't changed while window is opened.");

platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp
3145:                   ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG((xwa.map_state == IsViewable) && (wd.is_popup != p_enabled), "Popup flag can't changed while window is opened.");

platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp
2666:                   ERR_FAIL_COND_MSG(IsWindowVisible(wd.hWnd) && (wd.is_popup != p_enabled), "Popup flag can't changed while window is opened.");
```

